WEBVTT

00:02.400 --> 00:04.690
<b>Faldeus Dioland.</b>

00:04.690 --> 00:06.250
<b>He comes from a family of Mages</b>

00:06.250 --> 00:08.860
<b>that has specialized in
puppetry for generations...</b>

00:08.860 --> 00:10.910
<b>and is one of the masterminds who set up</b>

00:10.910 --> 00:13.530
<b>this Holy Grail War
in collusion with the States.</b>

00:13.530 --> 00:16.080
<b>During the Third Holy Grail War of Fuyuki,</b>

00:16.080 --> 00:19.620
<b>someone from Faldeus's family
participated as a Master.</b>

00:19.870 --> 00:23.880
<b>The Dioland Family partnered up
with a portion of the government...</b>

00:23.880 --> 00:27.340
<b>and tried to recreate
a Holy Grail War in the States.</b>

00:27.840 --> 00:29.700
<b>They plundered the land most suitable for</b>

00:29.700 --> 00:31.970
<b>the ritual from the guardians
of that territory...</b>

00:31.970 --> 00:34.970
<b>and relentlessly tampered
with the Leyline.</b>

00:34.970 --> 00:39.230
<b>And that place... is Snowfield.</b>

00:39.230 --> 00:41.520
<b>The project was halted for a time...</b>

00:41.520 --> 00:43.510
<b>but it quickly accelerated
after they managed</b>

00:43.510 --> 00:45.230
<b>to culture a piece of the Holy Grail...</b>

00:45.230 --> 00:46.520
<b>from Fuyuki on this land.</b>

00:47.280 --> 00:49.570
<b>But in the end,
it's nothing more than a fake.</b>

00:49.570 --> 00:54.160
<b>Compared to the real thing,
its connection to the Leyline is weak.</b>

00:54.160 --> 00:55.120
<b>So...</b>

00:55.740 --> 00:58.580
<b>they decided to summon
an additional seven real Servants...</b>

00:59.120 --> 01:04.540
<b>using us six Servants as primers.</b>

01:04.830 --> 01:09.010
<b>With a seven-day time limit to boot.</b>

01:11.010 --> 01:13.010
<b>Do not look back.</b>

01:13.010 --> 01:13.510
<b>DOST THOU HAVE CONVICTION?</b>

01:14.050 --> 01:16.470
<b>Dost thou have conviction?</b>

01:17.220 --> 01:23.440
<b>So long as thy conviction be retained,
thine shadow I am become.</b>

01:29.190 --> 01:30.860
<b>I see.</b>

01:31.240 --> 01:33.990
<b>So, this is the Holy Grail War.</b>

03:05.910 --> 03:08.330
<b>To think that a Dead
Apostle was a Master...</b>

03:08.330 --> 03:11.130
<b>Even I couldn't predict that at all!</b>

03:11.500 --> 03:13.590
<b>It's obvious that you're enjoying this...</b>

03:13.920 --> 03:15.130
<b>troublesome old hag.</b>

03:15.130 --> 03:16.760
<b>My, my, my.</b>

03:16.760 --> 03:20.550
<b>You know, being told that to my face
actually hurts my feelings.</b>

03:21.180 --> 03:25.430
<b>I've only been using this body
for three years, you know!</b>

03:26.180 --> 03:29.980
<b>The internal organs are
still really clean!</b>

03:31.860 --> 03:34.530
<b>Care to look? Wanna see?</b>

03:34.530 --> 03:36.320
<b>A girl's secret...</b>

03:36.690 --> 03:40.360
<b>in-ter-nal or-gans!</b>

03:40.990 --> 03:43.290
<b>If we leave that Dead Apostle
to do as he pleases,</b>

03:43.290 --> 03:45.620
<b>we'll end up with
civilian victims, as well.</b>

03:45.620 --> 03:48.370
<b>I thought you braced yourself
for civilian casualties...</b>

03:48.750 --> 03:53.090
<b>when you decided to use
this city as the stage.</b>

03:59.220 --> 04:02.720
<b>Are the States really going to proceed
with the project as planned?</b>

04:02.720 --> 04:04.220
<b>That's right!</b>

04:04.560 --> 04:06.310
<b>Every Master in the real Holy Grail War...</b>

04:06.720 --> 04:12.020
<b>has struck a deal with the States,
so you can rest assured, Orlando!</b>

04:12.310 --> 04:16.050
<b>Besides, there are parts of
the incidents from last night</b>

04:16.050 --> 04:18.240
<b>that I'm not amused about, either.</b>

04:18.610 --> 04:19.860
<b>What?</b>

04:20.490 --> 04:24.700
<b>I mean, the ones that stood out in the end
were the Executor and the Dead Apostle!</b>

04:24.700 --> 04:27.160
<b>No, no! That's a no!</b>

04:28.910 --> 04:33.840
<b>The stars of a Holy Grail War
have got to be the Servants and Masters!</b>

04:39.630 --> 04:42.140
<b>Now, let the show begin!</b>

04:42.760 --> 04:45.430
<b>Did you get a playbill?
Did you get popcorn?</b>

04:47.180 --> 04:48.310
<b>You gotta hurry...</b>

04:48.640 --> 04:51.310
<b>or you're gonna miss the
fight of the century!</b>

04:51.850 --> 04:52.480
<b>Huh?</b>

05:00.780 --> 05:01.650
<b>Lady Tiné!</b>

05:01.650 --> 05:03.570
<b>My king! Are you all right?</b>

05:04.910 --> 05:07.200
<b>What was that lightning?</b>

05:07.200 --> 05:09.500
<b>The lightning itself
was my Noble Phantasm.</b>

05:09.910 --> 05:14.540
<b>I set up an auto-defender
in case my friend decides to jest.</b>

05:22.130 --> 05:25.890
<b>I didn't think I'd have to repel
an arrow of the likes of a bowman.</b>

05:25.890 --> 05:27.220
<b>Bowman?</b>

05:27.220 --> 05:29.390
<b>However, the Archer-class—</b>

05:33.270 --> 05:34.350
<b>Tiné...</b>

05:34.350 --> 05:36.020
<b>Ride in the back.</b>

05:36.480 --> 05:38.360
<b>I-Is it all right?</b>

05:38.360 --> 05:42.360
<b>I can't fully protect you from
those ghastly arrows if I leave you here.</b>

05:42.820 --> 05:44.700
<b>As you are my Master...</b>

05:45.490 --> 05:48.580
<b>it would trouble me so if you were to die.</b>

05:49.040 --> 05:49.910
<b>Right.</b>

05:50.290 --> 05:52.620
<b>What the hell did you guys summon?</b>

05:52.910 --> 05:55.580
<b>You're going to ask that
in a Holy Grail War?</b>

05:56.210 --> 06:00.760
<b>Disclosing the True Name means you're
disclosing their weakness, you know.</b>

06:00.760 --> 06:03.550
<b>We are Mages, and we are policemen!</b>

06:03.880 --> 06:07.470
<b>Existences who rope in the residents of
the city with no particular reason...</b>

06:07.470 --> 06:09.260
<b>should be eradicated first and foremost!</b>

06:09.260 --> 06:11.810
<b>You really are square-headed.</b>

06:11.810 --> 06:13.850
<b>Then I guess I'll at
least give you a hint.</b>

06:14.440 --> 06:18.560
<b>The Holy Grail War doesn't summon
the gods themselves.</b>

06:18.560 --> 06:22.240
<b>But he's an exception
as he's only half-god.</b>

06:22.240 --> 06:24.900
<b>His strength is of a different level
compared to an ordinary Heroic Spirit...</b>

06:25.280 --> 06:29.780
<b>and in his heart,
hatred for the gods is boiling over!</b>

06:32.750 --> 06:35.040
<b>You're the one who staged
the surprise attack.</b>

06:35.410 --> 06:37.750
<b>You won't be begging for
your life now, will you?</b>

06:38.080 --> 06:39.090
<b>Two...</b>

06:39.500 --> 06:40.420
<b>Archers?</b>

06:41.170 --> 06:42.880
<b>His class may be Archer,</b>

06:42.880 --> 06:46.760
<b>but his very nature was changed
drastically when he was summoned.</b>

06:47.180 --> 06:49.760
<b>So, he is now a seeker of vengeance.</b>

06:49.760 --> 06:53.310
<b>Why don't we call that an "Avenger"?</b>

06:57.440 --> 06:58.650
<b>I see.</b>

06:59.440 --> 07:05.740
<b>Indeed, if I were fixated on victory,
I may toy around with such an idea, as well.</b>

07:06.280 --> 07:07.160
<b>However...</b>

07:07.860 --> 07:10.660
<b>that would only be
suitable because it is I!</b>

07:10.910 --> 07:13.660
<b>It is not an action that the mere likes
of you would be allowed to do!</b>

07:29.010 --> 07:29.840
<b>Hah!</b>

07:29.840 --> 07:32.930
<b>Looks like he has quite the
sticky fingers. Then...</b>

07:33.430 --> 07:34.640
<b>how about this?</b>

07:58.500 --> 07:59.540
<b>No way.</b>

08:04.300 --> 08:06.420
<b>The King of Heroes, huh?</b>

08:08.590 --> 08:10.380
<b>So weak.</b>

08:10.840 --> 08:11.930
<b>Oh?</b>

08:12.800 --> 08:19.140
<b>If you're just randomly throwing weapons
at me, you might as well be throwing sand!</b>

08:19.730 --> 08:22.940
<b>Draw the sword idling
in the furthest reaches of your storage.</b>

08:22.940 --> 08:24.610
<b>That will make us even.</b>

08:24.940 --> 08:27.820
<b>Ea might as well be my other self.</b>

08:27.820 --> 08:30.820
<b>It is not a sword I use
against weaklings like you.</b>

08:32.200 --> 08:34.450
<b>Prove to me that you are
a powerful opponent...</b>

08:34.450 --> 08:38.700
<b>worthy of an audience with Ea.</b>

08:39.540 --> 08:41.080
<b>How foolish.</b>

08:41.080 --> 08:44.090
<b>You would have spared yourself
from death had you drawn it.</b>

08:46.340 --> 08:48.460
<b>A tremendous divine aura.</b>

08:48.460 --> 08:52.010
<b>A Noble Phantasm. Its aura
is different from the gods I know...</b>

08:52.340 --> 08:54.720
<b>but in essence they are the same. Hmm?</b>

08:55.510 --> 08:56.430
<b>Gil...</b>

08:57.180 --> 09:00.140
<b>Looks like you're fighting someone
that might be pretty powerful.</b>

09:00.140 --> 09:01.020
<b>On top of that...</b>

09:01.480 --> 09:04.730
<b>another strong presence has appeared.</b>

09:08.860 --> 09:09.490
<b>Huh?</b>

09:18.240 --> 09:20.540
<b>That fiend is my prey!</b>

09:21.080 --> 09:23.170
<b>The two of you, don't meddle with him!</b>

09:30.590 --> 09:31.920
<b>Amazing.</b>

09:32.220 --> 09:33.630
<b>I'm awestruck!</b>

09:34.010 --> 09:35.550
<b>Did you know about this, Ayaka?</b>

09:35.550 --> 09:37.350
<b>What exactly is this music?</b>

09:38.350 --> 09:39.310
<b>What was I...</b>

09:40.020 --> 09:41.890
<b>doing again?</b>

09:42.310 --> 09:44.020
<b>Man, he's amazing!</b>

09:44.440 --> 09:46.020
<b>Your boyfriend!</b>

09:46.020 --> 09:48.110
<b>He said he's never touched
a guitar before...</b>

09:49.030 --> 09:51.190
<b>but he mastered it in no time!</b>

09:51.530 --> 09:54.360
<b>Oh no, he's not my boyfriend or anything.</b>

09:54.360 --> 09:55.530
<b>Where's he from?</b>

09:56.240 --> 09:59.410
<b>He's told us he's from England, but...</b>

10:00.160 --> 10:02.120
<b>I don't know, either.</b>

10:02.500 --> 10:04.620
<b>Nothing about him.</b>

10:04.620 --> 10:05.960
<b>Ayaka!</b>

10:06.380 --> 10:07.500
<b>Look!</b>

10:07.500 --> 10:10.050
<b>Isn't it great? They gave it to me!</b>

10:10.420 --> 10:13.380
<b>They say we're going to do
something called a "session" now...</b>

10:13.880 --> 10:15.800
<b>so I want you to take a listen, as well!</b>

10:18.760 --> 10:23.310
<b>This is exactly what they mean
when they say "raining on a parade," girl.</b>

10:40.990 --> 10:41.870
<b>Kalion!</b>

11:03.980 --> 11:06.600
<b>I see, so it's you.</b>

11:07.020 --> 11:08.560
<b>Queen of Betrayal.</b>

11:08.560 --> 11:11.440
<b>Archer!</b>

11:23.410 --> 11:24.790
<b>As I thought.</b>

11:25.160 --> 11:27.000
<b>That surely hit him.</b>

11:27.460 --> 11:28.960
<b>What in the world?</b>

11:28.960 --> 11:33.460
<b>He has armor that seems to be made from
the hide of a Demonic or Divine Beast.</b>

11:33.920 --> 11:38.050
<b>Was that also what blocked
Your Majesty's barrage of attacks earlier?</b>

11:38.050 --> 11:42.680
<b>Any and every tool crafted by human hands
will not work against that thing.</b>

11:43.310 --> 11:48.100
<b>Why do you not harbor my father's power,
the power of the war belt, upon your body?</b>

11:48.100 --> 11:51.900
<b>The power of gods is not something
to harbor on one's body.</b>

11:52.270 --> 11:53.440
<b>What?</b>

11:53.440 --> 11:59.110
<b>It is something to force into submission,
trample upon and control with human might!</b>

12:00.410 --> 12:01.200
<b>What...</b>

12:01.570 --> 12:03.200
<b>is that power?</b>

12:12.210 --> 12:14.460
<b>I thought I told you
to not get in the way!</b>

12:14.750 --> 12:16.170
<b>Fool!</b>

12:16.170 --> 12:19.210
<b>I have no ear to lend for
one with such insolence</b>

12:19.210 --> 12:22.430
<b>that they do not dismount before the king!</b>

12:22.800 --> 12:24.140
<b>Get lost at once!</b>

13:06.180 --> 13:10.140
<b>Of all things, you direct
the power of some god against me?</b>

13:10.890 --> 13:13.100
<b>Your insolence knows no bounds, woman.</b>

13:13.560 --> 13:18.730
<b>If you're going to bar my way any further,
I will eliminate you first, golden king.</b>

13:19.280 --> 13:22.860
<b>Get in your way?
Am I not, in truth, your salvation?</b>

13:22.860 --> 13:23.780
<b>What?</b>

13:23.780 --> 13:25.950
<b>You and that bowman over there...</b>

13:25.950 --> 13:28.830
<b>stand on different levels
as Heroic Spirits.</b>

13:28.830 --> 13:32.830
<b>Surely you are not so simple
that you can't even understand that.</b>

13:32.830 --> 13:36.960
<b>I understand that he surpasses my best...</b>

13:37.340 --> 13:40.130
<b>because I died at his hands!</b>

13:41.760 --> 13:45.340
<b>However, at this point,
my end is of little importance.</b>

13:45.890 --> 13:47.100
<b>Answer me!</b>

13:47.100 --> 13:50.060
<b>Why did you target that young child?</b>

13:51.100 --> 13:55.150
<b>Though they are a child,
they are a Mage who joined the war.</b>

13:55.150 --> 13:58.150
<b>I have no reason to be merciful!</b>

13:58.150 --> 14:00.990
<b>I don't want to hear
some common and cliché reasoning.</b>

14:01.530 --> 14:02.860
<b>You...</b>

14:02.860 --> 14:04.280
<b>You, of all people...</b>

14:04.280 --> 14:07.450
<b>were a man I thought could
never do such a thing!</b>

14:07.830 --> 14:12.290
<b><i>That cavalrywoman is angry
that the bowman targeted me?</i></b>

14:12.790 --> 14:15.000
<b><i>More than the fact that she was killed.</i></b>

14:16.170 --> 14:16.960
<b><i>They don't...</i></b>

14:17.540 --> 14:20.340
<b><i>even perceive me as an opponent.</i></b>

14:21.050 --> 14:26.550
<b>Gleefully pointing your bow at a child
is something you would never allow!</b>

14:26.890 --> 14:31.140
<b>Songs of awe and reverence for you
echoed to the ends of my homeland!</b>

14:31.560 --> 14:34.520
<b>Have you discarded
your god-praising name, O Heracl—</b>

14:34.520 --> 14:35.900
<b>Silence!</b>

14:37.650 --> 14:40.320
<b>A hero of that name doesn't exist!</b>

14:40.690 --> 14:44.030
<b>No, he was never even a hero!</b>

14:44.530 --> 14:47.320
<b>I am nothing more than a human.</b>

14:47.320 --> 14:49.990
<b>I seek vengeance upon the gods.</b>

14:50.910 --> 14:52.950
<b>Huh? Where are you going?</b>

14:52.950 --> 14:55.370
<b>To deal with the situation, of course.</b>

14:55.370 --> 14:58.000
<b>You don't have to get
so worked up about it.</b>

14:58.000 --> 15:00.380
<b>I already dealt with it.</b>

15:00.750 --> 15:01.800
<b>What?</b>

15:01.800 --> 15:02.590
<b>Right now...</b>

15:02.920 --> 15:07.010
<b>my Servant is heading
there to run interference!</b>

15:07.550 --> 15:08.760
<b>Huh?</b>

15:09.640 --> 15:11.010
<b>I see.</b>

15:11.010 --> 15:14.310
<b>You are no longer that man.</b>

15:15.180 --> 15:19.770
<b>Then I shall not say I will right you
back onto the proper path.</b>

15:20.480 --> 15:21.730
<b>Are you going to don it?</b>

15:22.650 --> 15:24.320
<b>The power of the gods.</b>

15:25.700 --> 15:27.660
<b>You, as well as the golden king...</b>

15:27.860 --> 15:30.580
<b>I will eradicate as enemies!</b>

15:30.950 --> 15:32.660
<b>How you bark, girl!</b>

15:33.290 --> 15:37.620
<b>You dare lump me, a king,
in with a mere vengeance seeker?</b>

15:37.960 --> 15:39.580
<b>A favorable start.</b>

15:40.460 --> 15:43.960
<b>I can certainly bring down two demigods.</b>

15:47.550 --> 15:49.550
<b><i>Okay, that's enough.</i></b>

15:52.890 --> 15:55.100
<b>This is... a forced teleport?</b>

15:55.100 --> 15:57.980
<b><i>That's no good, all of you.
You must cool your heads.</i></b>

15:58.730 --> 16:01.690
<b><i>What are you doing, pulling out
your trump cards in the very beginning?</i></b>

16:02.360 --> 16:04.760
<b>To think there would be
even more disrespectful</b>

16:04.760 --> 16:06.650
<b>agitators blighting my entertainment.</b>

16:07.070 --> 16:11.450
<b>Did you think an illusion of this caliber
could deceive my eyes?</b>

16:11.450 --> 16:14.080
<b><i>Nothing less from the King of Heroes!</i></b>

16:14.080 --> 16:18.370
<b><i>I don't think I'll be able to deceive
your sharp eyes!</i></b>

16:18.370 --> 16:20.500
<b>But what about your ears...</b>

16:20.920 --> 16:21.960
<b>Gil?</b>

16:27.630 --> 16:32.220
<b>Who granted permission for you
to take the guise and voice of my friend?</b>

16:33.010 --> 16:36.270
<b>On top of that, you try
to use it to deceive me?</b>

16:36.270 --> 16:38.430
<b>Even death will not suffice as punishment!</b>

16:38.940 --> 16:41.100
<b>An illusion-weaver.</b>

16:42.360 --> 16:44.520
<b>You're telling me to retreat, Master?</b>

16:45.020 --> 16:47.400
<b>All right. I shall abide by your orders.</b>

16:47.990 --> 16:51.610
<b>Golden king, and revenger
who deceives himself!</b>

16:52.110 --> 16:53.920
<b>I swear that next time,</b>

16:53.920 --> 16:56.830
<b>I will honor our battle
and settle things as a warrior!</b>

16:57.660 --> 17:01.000
<b>You think I'd allow
such a disrespectful agitator leave, girl?</b>

17:02.000 --> 17:03.330
<b>But all right.</b>

17:03.920 --> 17:06.670
<b>In magnanimity, I shall grant you pardon.</b>

17:07.300 --> 17:11.760
<b>Mongrel, there is no meaning for you
to hide your True Name anymore, is there?</b>

17:12.680 --> 17:16.260
<b>If your objective is to
violate part of my self...</b>

17:16.720 --> 17:20.770
<b>naming yourself shall get you close
to that lofty goal!</b>

17:21.520 --> 17:23.730
<b>My name is Alcides.</b>

17:24.270 --> 17:26.110
<b>Golden king...</b>

17:26.110 --> 17:28.110
<b>You are a powerful monarch...</b>

17:28.110 --> 17:31.610
<b>such that the sovereigns I know
cannot compare...</b>

17:31.610 --> 17:33.320
<b>and yet, you are weak as a warrior.</b>

17:34.700 --> 17:36.030
<b>Next time...</b>

17:36.030 --> 17:38.590
<b>I shall trample upon the power of the gods</b>

17:38.590 --> 17:41.870
<b>that lay dormant in the
furthest reaches within you.</b>

17:45.170 --> 17:50.340
<b>Now that he has disclosed his True Name,
it's meaningless for me to hide mine.</b>

17:51.970 --> 17:53.840
<b>My name is Hippolyta!</b>

17:53.840 --> 17:57.260
<b>Child of Otrera and the war god Ares!</b>

17:57.930 --> 18:01.730
<b>I am the queen of the proud tribe
known as "the Amazons"!</b>

18:01.730 --> 18:06.440
<b>Golden king and his young vassal,
we shall cross paths once again!</b>

18:10.190 --> 18:11.400
<b><i>My, my.</i></b>

18:11.400 --> 18:12.860
<b><i>They all went home.</i></b>

18:13.200 --> 18:15.910
<b><i>Then I guess we'll retreat
for now, as well.</i></b>

18:15.910 --> 18:18.370
<b>My judgment has not
changed, you lowly wretch.</b>

18:18.370 --> 18:21.250
<b>Even "mongrel" is too esteemed for you.</b>

18:21.450 --> 18:23.370
<b><i>See you again, King and company!</i></b>

18:23.370 --> 18:26.330
<b><i>Come find me if you desire
to truly fall from grace!</i></b>

18:30.340 --> 18:31.760
<b>I humbly ask.</b>

18:32.260 --> 18:35.590
<b>Your Majesty, was it all right for you
to not give your name, as well?</b>

18:37.510 --> 18:40.430
<b>They're not worthy of
hearing my name just yet.</b>

18:40.770 --> 18:46.940
<b>If they stand before me once more,
I will grant them the honor.</b>

18:48.190 --> 18:49.650
<b>You weren't sleepy or anything...</b>

18:49.900 --> 18:51.070
<b>Ayaka?</b>

18:51.070 --> 18:54.780
<b>The guitar was so loud,
I couldn't help but be wide awake.</b>

18:55.150 --> 18:56.660
<b>I'm sorry about that.</b>

18:56.660 --> 18:57.490
<b>Oh, no.</b>

18:57.990 --> 18:59.530
<b>I didn't mean it that way.</b>

18:59.530 --> 19:03.410
<b>There aren't any Mystic Codes
or surveillance systems here.</b>

19:03.410 --> 19:04.960
<b>Now is the time to sleep if anything.</b>

19:04.960 --> 19:05.580
<b>Huh?</b>

19:06.290 --> 19:09.460
<b>So, you didn't forget
about the Holy Grail War.</b>

19:09.790 --> 19:12.380
<b>Then what you were doing up until now
was all an act?</b>

19:12.380 --> 19:13.800
<b>Of course not!</b>

19:14.300 --> 19:16.550
<b>Oh, I was really touched!</b>

19:16.970 --> 19:20.390
<b>To come across a melody
that has changed so much from my times...</b>

19:20.390 --> 19:22.520
<b>What a stroke of good luck!</b>

19:23.140 --> 19:24.430
<b>Hey...</b>

19:24.430 --> 19:27.400
<b>What are you planning to wish
from the Holy Grail?</b>

19:27.400 --> 19:32.480
<b>This is unusual for you
to ask something about the Holy Grail War.</b>

19:33.110 --> 19:37.950
<b>If you have a reason dear to you,
I have a need to apologize to you.</b>

19:38.360 --> 19:41.490
<b>Because I don't think I'll
be of any help to you.</b>

19:41.490 --> 19:45.120
<b>You provide me the magical power
to materialize in this world.</b>

19:45.120 --> 19:46.910
<b>No way you are not helping at all.</b>

19:47.540 --> 19:48.540
<b>Besides...</b>

19:48.830 --> 19:51.420
<b>the reason why I seek the Grail...</b>

19:51.420 --> 19:53.050
<b>I'd like to know that myself.</b>

19:53.340 --> 19:54.300
<b>Huh?</b>

19:54.300 --> 19:55.300
<b>What do you mean?</b>

19:56.220 --> 19:59.510
<b>Didn't you answer the summoning
because you sought the Holy Grail?</b>

19:59.510 --> 20:02.310
<b>Thinking logically, that
should be the case...</b>

20:02.720 --> 20:06.270
<b>but even I, the one who was summoned,
don't know of a clear-cut reason.</b>

20:06.890 --> 20:10.650
<b>I'd be lying if I said I didn't have
regrets remaining from when I was alive.</b>

20:10.650 --> 20:13.320
<b>But it's not something
I'd wish upon a Grail over.</b>

20:13.650 --> 20:16.110
<b>The Holy Grail is what
King Arthur once sought.</b>

20:16.110 --> 20:19.360
<b>I'd like to win it and
donate it to his grave.</b>

20:19.360 --> 20:22.030
<b>But it's not something I want so badly...</b>

20:22.030 --> 20:23.940
<b>I'd trample upon the great
wishes of other heroes</b>

20:23.940 --> 20:26.330
<b>or put someone else in
the face of danger for.</b>

20:26.750 --> 20:27.710
<b>Huh?</b>

20:28.710 --> 20:32.380
<b>You're right. That's not something
I should say after being shot by you...</b>

20:32.380 --> 20:35.130
<b>while I was blinded
by the treasures of the Round Table.</b>

20:35.130 --> 20:37.170
<b>You're speaking to
someone invisible again.</b>

20:37.470 --> 20:38.530
<b>Let me introduce you.</b>

20:38.530 --> 20:41.260
<b>I'm going to make the Magical Energy
path a bit stronger, all right?</b>

20:41.260 --> 20:42.140
<b>Huh? Hold on—</b>

20:49.940 --> 20:51.350
<b>That just now...</b>

20:51.350 --> 20:52.480
<b>Pierre Basile.</b>

20:53.110 --> 20:54.440
<b>The man who killed me.</b>

20:54.730 --> 20:55.520
<b>Huh?</b>

20:55.520 --> 20:59.150
<b>I have two Noble Phantasms I can use,
or rather, I have two aces up my sleeve.</b>

20:59.490 --> 21:05.080
<b>One is the power to have the souls I chose
accompany me with their agreement.</b>

21:05.080 --> 21:07.540
<b>It's hard right now to
make them materialize,</b>

21:07.540 --> 21:10.080
<b>but I can have them assist
with techniques or Magecraft.</b>

21:10.080 --> 21:11.040
<b>No, wait—</b>

21:11.500 --> 21:12.960
<b>- The other is—
- Hold on a second!</b>

21:13.380 --> 21:14.340
<b>What's wrong?</b>

21:14.340 --> 21:15.290
<b>What's this so suddenly?</b>

21:15.960 --> 21:17.960
<b>The name of the guy who killed you?</b>

21:17.960 --> 21:20.300
<b>That's basically telling
me your True Name!</b>

21:20.300 --> 21:21.300
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:21.300 --> 21:24.260
<b>I plan on disclosing my
True Name to you now.</b>

21:24.550 --> 21:26.260
<b>What are you thinking?</b>

21:26.260 --> 21:29.310
<b>I told you that I'll tell you my True Name
in due time, didn't I?</b>

21:29.310 --> 21:31.600
<b>Right now, there are no worries
of other Mages listening in on us—</b>

21:31.600 --> 21:32.350
<b>Stop it!</b>

21:32.940 --> 21:36.020
<b>I told you that I'm not participating
in a Holy Grail War.</b>

21:36.020 --> 21:38.650
<b>You and I are simply connected
through Magical Energy.</b>

21:38.650 --> 21:40.820
<b>I am nothing more than a civilian!</b>

21:41.200 --> 21:42.610
<b>So...</b>

21:42.610 --> 21:46.530
<b>save your True Name
until you find a much better Master.</b>

21:47.370 --> 21:48.240
<b>I see.</b>

21:49.000 --> 21:50.250
<b>You're right.</b>

21:50.250 --> 21:53.960
<b>I will disclose my True Name
when I come across a great Master.</b>

21:55.840 --> 21:57.170
<b>You do that.</b>

21:58.710 --> 22:00.590
<b>My name is Richard!</b>

22:00.590 --> 22:04.390
<b>Duke of Normandy and King of England!</b>

22:04.930 --> 22:09.970
<b>Perhaps the sobriquet
"Lionheart" is more famous?</b>

22:07.470 --> 22:09.970
<b>EPISODE 4</b>
